#show: overview

Use `tola <command> --help` for command-line flags.

Look up a configuration table with `tola help "[build]"`, a Typst package export with `tola help "@tola/address" slugify`, or a built-in script with `tola help scripts`. Pass `--lang zh` for Simplified Chinese, or `--all --format json` to export the complete reference catalog.

Run `tola help -i` to browse interactively in the terminal: press `→` to expand a group, `/` to search, `Tab` to focus search results, `Ctrl+G` to return to the tree, `Enter` to open the selection, and `q` to go back or quit.

For task-focused authoring guides, run `tola skill --list`.
